You are helping build a RUL prediction project on NASA C-MAPSS dataset.

STRICT PROJECT STRUCTURE — never deviate from this:

rul_cmapss/
├── data/
│   ├── raw/          ← raw .txt files go here
│   └── processed/    ← .npy files saved here
├── models/
│   └── saved/        ← model .pt and scaler.pkl saved here
├── logs/
│   └── plots/        ← plots saved here
├── config/
│   └── config.yaml   ← all paths and hyperparams
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── ingestion.py
│   ├── transformation.py
│   ├── trainer.py
│   ├── evaluator.py
│   ├── predictor.py
│   └── utils.py
├── tests/
├── notebooks/
├── main.py
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md

RULES:
- Never create folders outside this structure
- Always read paths from config/config.yaml
- Never hardcode any paths
- Always use pathlib.Path
- Always use type hints and docstrings
- Always use logger from src/utils.py
- Dataset is NASA C-MAPSS with subsets FD001-FD004
- Default model is LSTM using PyTorch